      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "May not be technically feasible as far as I understand it. The notifications expire after 15 minutes, but the permissions to join may not ever expire for that instance once someone has been invited, allowing that user to self-invite themselves at any point past the 15 minutes to the instance after receiving join permissions via an invite from someone else.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
