  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-11-28T04:21:39.023Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Invites always expire after 15 minutes.\n\nThat's too long when I want to gather people quickly, because I'm stuck waiting without knowing who will come. It's too short when friends can join anytime, because the invite expires and I may miss their Request Invite.\n\nPlease let the sender choose the expiration when sending an invite (e.g. 5 min / 10 min / 15 min (default) / 1 hour / until I leave the instance), and show the remaining time to both the recipient and the sender.",
